%% Lab 15: where code runs. The agent's run_python sends model-written code only to the container or the hosted sandbox,
%% and refuses when neither is there. The subprocess runs only the probe we wrote (Part B), never model-written code.
%% Ink: what the model does. Lime: what our code decides. White: where code runs, with what the probe found there.
%% Export: npx -y @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli -i lab15_three_runners.mmd -o lab15_three_runners.png -b white -s 2
flowchart LR
    agent[Chart agent<br/>writes Python] -->|run_python code| tool{run_python<br/>our code decides}
    tool -->|Docker running| box[Container<br/>no network, read-only root,<br/>one folder mounted<br/>.env found: False]
    tool -->|no Docker| hosted[Hosted code interpreter<br/>another machine<br/>.env found: False]
    tool -->|neither| refuse[Refuses<br/>never runs code here]
    probe[Our probe<br/>fixed text, Part B only] -.-> sub[Subprocess on your machine<br/>timeout, working folder<br/>.env found: True]
    classDef model fill:#0B1220,color:#FFFFFF,stroke:#0B1220
    classDef code fill:#C9F24D,color:#0B1220,stroke:#0B1220
    class agent model
    class tool,refuse,probe code
